(text "INPUTS 5-8: PROTECTED SENSING AND ADC" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid 4ca42549-4537-5511-a015-33a9a0d75906))
(text "Two 165k resistors limit input current.\nD1-D12 clamp switch SOURCE pins only.\n100k source bleeds permit startup with DUT connected.\nSwitches isolate ADC and bias when disabled." (at 25 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid ef2a2482-15dc-587d-979b-42e0d9acc687))
(text "470pF filters are on the ADC side.\nVpin difference = 37.3 x ADC voltage difference (nominal).\nMeasure one live DC pair, other terminals open." (at 230 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid da6b7842-3f68-517c-a887-66e2eaf52987))
(text "12V nominal; 0-18V intended measurement range.\n48V DC miswire target requires prototype verification.\nDo not connect any terminal directly to AGND or USB_GND." (at 25 242 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid c853da63-e32d-5349-b8a3-fd274011c9ea))
)
